# Copy to .github/CODEOWNERS only after choosing real owners.
# Owners must have sufficient repository access. Teams must be visible and
# have explicit write access. Replace example-owner, then uncomment rules.
# Put more specific rules after broader ones; the last matching rule wins.

# *                         @example-owner
# /.github/                 @example-owner
# /scripts/checks/          @example-owner
# /tests/tooling/checks/    @example-owner
# /LICENSE                  @example-owner
# /DCO                      @example-owner
# /CONTRIBUTING.md           @example-owner
# /CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md        @example-owner
# /SECURITY.md               @example-owner

# Enable required code-owner review separately in the branch ruleset.
